{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03005",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.98,
      "end_seconds": 10.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "alright, that's fine, sit down tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.13,
      "end_seconds": 20.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "I wanted to get vomiting once or twice looked at. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.01,
      "end_seconds": 25.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.14,
      "end_seconds": 28.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "About... well, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.18,
      "end_seconds": 31.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.79,
      "end_seconds": 58.93,
      "duration_seconds": 26.14,
      "text": "Only sips of fluid, you know, and it's not much. Right, um, I've also had loose stools, for about four days. Um, uh, I've also had a mild tummy ache, for about two weeks. I mean, uh, with mild tummy ache, mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.46,
      "end_seconds": 67.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Have you had vomiting once or twice before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.23,
      "end_seconds": 74.57,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.17,
      "end_seconds": 92.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.59,
      "end_seconds": 103.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.29,
      "end_seconds": 127.69,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, pulse is 64 beats a a minute, blood pressure 108 over 72, temperature is 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.34,
      "end_seconds": 134.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.12,
      "end_seconds": 138.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.18,
      "end_seconds": 151.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "He is alert, drinking, with moist lips and a soft tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.64,
      "end_seconds": 164.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. A few quick ones: drowsiness, no wet nappies, high fever or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.51,
      "end_seconds": 167.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.54,
      "end_seconds": 171.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.49,
      "end_seconds": 173.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.49,
      "end_seconds": 196.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.69,
      "end_seconds": 207.7,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "I, I think I reacted to to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.39,
      "end_seconds": 212.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.12,
      "end_seconds": 229.2,
      "duration_seconds": 16.08,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I've never touched a cigarette. I look after my grandchildren most days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.06,
      "end_seconds": 236.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.02,
      "end_seconds": 246.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "Seretide inhaler, twice a day. Oral rehydration solution i take it 1 sachet, after each loose stool"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.61,
      "end_seconds": 260.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.05,
      "end_seconds": 268.7,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Actually, you know, just a caesarean for my second baby, nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.64,
      "end_seconds": 274.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.49,
      "end_seconds": 290.78,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had asthma for about ten years now. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.95,
      "end_seconds": 310.81,
      "duration_seconds": 15.86,
      "text": "Right, so asthma is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with a mild stomach bug at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.15,
      "end_seconds": 316.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Ah, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.6,
      "end_seconds": 336.69,
      "duration_seconds": 18.09,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a mild stomach bug. Just to be sure I understood. You've had vomiting once or twice for two weeks, and no blood in the stool or drowsiness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.05,
      "end_seconds": 338.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.35,
      "end_seconds": 348.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Small, frequent sips of fluid and keep him off nursery for two days after it stops. Let's review you if he is not drinking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 350.98,
      "end_seconds": 356.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.06,
      "end_seconds": 363.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Right, that's the the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.65,
      "end_seconds": 367.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "alright, thanks, take care"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.72,
      "end_seconds": 374.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "goodbye for now"
    }
  ]
}